# Everything in this repo is LF in the index, and some of it is executed as
# shell on a Linux host by piping the file straight to `ssh … bash`. A CRLF
# checkout silently breaks those scripts (jq programs, heredocs, shebangs), so
# line endings are pinned rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
